# AutoWashPro Mobile — UI Conventions

> Style: **Modern Minimal + Premium** với bảng màu **Xanh dương tin cậy** (#2563EB).
> Áp dụng cho toàn bộ `AutoWashProApp/src/**` và `AutoWashProApp/app/**`.

---

## 1. Theme System

### 1.1 Colors — luôn dùng hook

```tsx
// ✅ ĐÚNG — dynamic, hỗ trợ dark mode
import { useColors } from '../../src/theme/ThemeContext';
const colors = useColors();
<Text style={{ color: colors.textPrimary }}>...</Text>

// ⚠️ BACKWARD-COMPAT — chỉ dùng trong services, contexts, file không có access tới theme
import { colors } from '../../src/theme/colors'; // lightColors fallback
```

### 1.2 Typography

```tsx
import { Text } from '../../src/components/common';

<Text variant="h1">Tiêu đề</Text>
<Text variant="body" weight="600">Body bold</Text>
<Text variant="caption" color="textSecondary">Caption</Text>
<Text variant="price" color="primary">250.000 ₫</Text>   // tabular-nums tự động
```

Variants: `display`, `displaySm`, `h1`–`h4`, `bodyLarge`, `body`, `bodySmall`, `caption`, `button`, `buttonSmall`, `label`, `labelSmall`, `overline`, `price`, `priceLarge`, `priceSmall`.

### 1.3 Spacing — 4pt / 8dp grid

| Token | Value | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `xs` | 4 | gap nhỏ |
| `sm` | 8 | padding tight |
| `md` | 16 | spacing chuẩn |
| `lg` | 24 | section gap |
| `xl` | 32 | page padding dọc |
| `xxl` | 48 | bottom safe area |

```tsx
import { spacing, borderRadius, shadows } from '../../src/theme/spacing';
<View style={{ padding: spacing.md, borderRadius: borderRadius.lg, ...shadows.sm }} />
```

### 1.4 Tokens

```tsx
import { duration, opacity, zIndex, scale, elevation } from '../../src/theme/tokens';
```

- Animation: 150/200/250/300/350ms (page transitions)
- Skeleton shimmer: `duration.shimmer` (1500ms)
- Touch target tối thiểu: 44pt
- Scale press feedback: `0.95`–`0.98`

### 1.5 Gradients

```tsx
import { toGradientColors, getGradients } from '../../src/theme/gradients';
import { useTheme } from '../../src/theme/ThemeContext';

const { isDark } = useTheme();
const gradients = getGradients(isDark);

<LinearGradient
  colors={toGradientColors(gradients.hero)}
  start={{ x: 0, y: 0 }}
  end={{ x: 1, y: 1 }}
>
```

> Luôn dùng `toGradientColors(gradients.X)` để convert từ `GradientStop[]` sang
> `string[]` mà `expo-linear-gradient` yêu cầu. Tránh `.map((s) => s.color) as any`
> vì sẽ ném `NullPointerException` trên native.

Hoặc dùng `<Header variant="gradient" />` / `<ScreenContainer background="gradient" />` thay vì tự wrap.

