## 2. Components

### 2.1 Cấu trúc chuẩn của một screen

```tsx
import {
  ScreenContainer,
  Header,
  Card,
  Button,
  Text as AppText,
  Icon,
} from '../../src/components/common';
import { useColors } from '../../src/theme/ThemeContext';

export default function MyScreen() {
  const router = useRouter();
  const colors = useColors();

  return (
    <ScreenContainer background="subtle">
      <Header title="Tiêu đề" showBack rightAction={<IconButton ... />} />
      {/* body */}
    </ScreenContainer>
  );
}
```

### 2.2 Danh sách components

| Component | Khi nào dùng |
|---|---|
| `ScreenContainer` | Wrapper mọi screen (thay SafeAreaView + ScrollView + padding thủ công) |
| `Header` | Top bar: `variant="standard"` / `"large"` / `"gradient"`, `showBack`, `rightAction` |
| `Button` | CTA: `variant="primary"` / `"secondary"` / `"outline"` / `"ghost"` / `"gradient"` / `"danger"`, `size="small"` / `"medium"` / `"large"` |
| `IconButton` | Touch-compliant icon button (hitSlop 8, accessibilityLabel bắt buộc) |
| `Text` | Typography wrapper (hỗ trợ variant, weight, color tokens) |
| `Card` | Container content: `variant="default"` / `"outlined"` / `"elevated"` / `"flat"`, có onPress |
| `Input` | Form input: label, error, hint, password toggle |
| `SearchBar` | Tìm kiếm có focus animation |
| `Chip` | Pill/tag/filter có variant + selected state |
| `Badge` | Status indicator (`BookingStatusBadge`, `PaymentStatusBadge`, `TierBadge`) |
| `StatCard` | Metric card (label + value + icon + trend) |
| `SectionHeader` | Section title với action link |
| `ListItem` | Row pattern: icon + title + subtitle + trailing |
| `SegmentedControl` | Tab filter trong page (history, payment) |
| `EmptyState` | Empty/error state với icon + message + CTA |
| `Skeleton` / `SkeletonListItem` / `SkeletonCard` | Loading placeholders với shimmer 1500ms |
| `Loading` / `LoadingOverlay` | Spinner |
| `BottomSheet` | Modal sheet (swipe-down, backdrop dismiss) |
| `Toast` / `useToast()` | Non-blocking feedback (thay `Alert.alert` khi có thể) |
| `PressableScale` | Interactive wrapper với scale animation |
| `Icon`, `Icons` | Vector icon (Ionicons); **không emoji** |

### 2.3 Patterns thường dùng

#### List view với pull-to-refresh

```tsx
<ScreenContainer background="subtle">
  <Header title="..." showBack />
  <FlatList
    data={items}
    renderItem={renderItem}
    keyExtractor={(it) => it.id}
    contentContainerStyle={{ padding: 16 }}
    refreshControl={
      <RefreshControl
        refreshing={isRefreshing}
        onRefresh={onRefresh}
        colors={[colors.primary]}
        tintColor={colors.primary}
      />
    }
    ListEmptyComponent={<EmptyState iconName="..." title="..." message="..." />}
  />
</ScreenContainer>
```

#### Form

```tsx
<ScreenContainer keyboardAvoiding>
  <Header title="..." showBack />
  <ScrollView contentContainerStyle={{ padding: 20 }} keyboardShouldPersistTaps="handled">
    <Input label="..." value={x} onChangeText={setX} error={errors.x} />
    <Button title="Lưu" onPress={save} fullWidth size="large" />
  </ScrollView>
</ScreenContainer>
```

#### Confirm dialog (BottomSheet thay Alert)

```tsx
const [open, setOpen] = useState(false);

<BottomSheet visible={open} onClose={() => setOpen(false)} title="Xác nhận">
  <View style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
    <Button title="Hủy" variant="outline" onPress={() => setOpen(false)} style={{ flex: 1 }} />
    <Button title="Đồng ý" variant="danger" onPress={confirm} style={{ flex: 1 }} />
  </View>
</BottomSheet>
```

