## 5. Haptics

Dùng `expo-haptics` cho mọi interactive action quan trọng:

```tsx
import * as Haptics from 'expo-haptics';

const handlePress = () => {
  try { Haptics.selectionAsync(); } catch {}
  // light tap cho selection, tab switch
  // Haptics.impactAsync(Haptics.ImpactFeedbackStyle.Light) cho primary CTA
  // Haptics.impactAsync(Haptics.ImpactFeedbackStyle.Medium) cho destructive
};
```

Button component đã tích hợp sẵn qua prop `hapticFeedback` / `hapticStyle`.

