## 9. Common Mistakes

❌ Import colors tĩnh trong component:
```tsx
import { colors } from '../../src/theme/colors';
```

❌ Emoji làm icon:
```tsx
<Text style={{ fontSize: 24 }}>🚗</Text>
```

❌ Inline hex colors:
```tsx
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#2563EB' }} />
```

❌ Custom back button text:
```tsx
<TouchableOpacity onPress={router.back}><Text>←</Text></TouchableOpacity>
```

❌ Alert.alert cho confirm thông thường:
```tsx
Alert.alert('Xác nhận', '...', [...]);
```

❌ TouchableOpacity cho icon-only button thiếu accessibilityLabel:
```tsx
<TouchableOpacity onPress={...}><Icon name="close" /></TouchableOpacity>
```

❌ Hardcoded sizes:
```tsx
padding: 13 // phải là 12 hoặc 14
```

